 not touch another arrow?  Join the challenge and the fun...\n\nAdd Who Do You Voo Doo to your collection today.", "short_description": "Ever wish you had a Voo Doo doll of your enemies?  Well, now you can!  Who Do You Voo Doo makes you the Voo Doo Master.  Name your doll, take aim & fire your Voo Doo arrows at the doll.  But be careful, if you hit another arrow, your enemy will live to terrorize again!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames/who-do-you-voo-doo-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "John Ray", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6349789538478693"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974671_1224598185222306_5957739153293738442_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FmjPboU7QaUQ7kNvwEMxkec&_nc_oc=AdpncZg8oqbrhPj81LzEZAag-yaDsmhSbem4Zor6s56HdlB0bkQw3z8PLw9_71aMMxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMHlxNK_ehijfOzgkf351Ci0y43RpkWROjSOaTVNmOx8w&oe=6AC3A84A"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display